@base = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@key = replace-with-Server-ApiKey-if-configured

### Models
GET {{base}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Chat Completions: the server executes add, then asks the model to finish
POST {{base}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

{
  "model": "mini-agent",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "请使用 add 工具计算 2 + 3，然后说明结果。" }],
  "max_completion_tokens": 1024
}

### Responses: same agent, independently configured upstream protocol
POST {{base}}/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

{
  "model": "mini-agent",
  "input": "请使用 add 工具计算 2 + 3，然后说明结果。",
  "max_output_tokens": 1024,
  "store": true
}

### Buffered Responses SSE
POST {{base}}/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

{
  "model": "mini-agent",
  "input": "你好",
  "stream": true
}

### Client-owned function: returned to the caller, not executed by the server
POST {{base}}/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

{
  "model": "mini-agent",
  "input": "查询上海天气",
  "tools": [{
    "type": "function",
    "name": "weather",
    "description": "Query weather for a city",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": { "city": { "type": "string" } },
      "required": ["city"],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "strict": true
  }],
  "tool_choice": { "type": "function", "name": "weather" }
}

### Fill in the response ID and call_id from the previous response
POST {{base}}/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

{
  "model": "mini-agent",
  "previous_response_id": "resp_REPLACE",
  "input": [{ "type": "function_call_output", "call_id": "call_REPLACE", "output": "晴，24°C" }]
}
